  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-bootstrap-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with `name:` front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow`.\n\nThe file has one top-level heading, `# Bootstrap requirements`. Its first sub-section is `## Workflow`, which comes before `## Inventories`, `## Proposing requirements`, `## Tagging`, `## Report` and `## Gotchas`. The workflow is a numbered checklist, `- [ ] 1.` through `- [ ] 9.`, with nested a, b and c sub-steps under step 7. These are ordered steps.\n\nTwo short intro paragraphs sit between the title and `## Workflow`. They are part of the title section's own body, not a separate section. `habeas-evidence/SKILL.md` also puts its preface text inside `## Workflow`. So no other section comes before the workflow, and I found no gap.",
  "inputs": [
